?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u27599?\u31186?\u30334?\u19975?\u27425?\u25351?\u20196? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u27599?\u31186?\u30334?\u19975?\u27425?\u28014?\u28857?\u-28720?\u31639?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u27599?\u31186?\u25968?\u25454?\u25253?\u25991? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u20301?\u27599?\u31186?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 64\u12289?\u22312?\u31995?\u32479?\u25925?\u-26980?\u19982?\u-27154?\u-26472?\u31649?\u29702?\u20013?\u-244?\u-27154?\u-26472?\u-26492?\u-27086?\u30340?\u27969?\u31243?\u20027?\u-30335?\u21253?\u25324?\u-29301?\u21183?\u20998?\u26512?\u21644?______\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u-29693?\u26597?\u20998?\u26512? \u160?B\u-242?\u-27367?\u-29713?\u25511?\u21046? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u21046?\u23450?\u-26492?\u-27086?\u25514?\u26045? \u160?D\u-242?\u-27154?\u-26472?\u20998?\u31867?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 65\u12289?\u20449?\u24687?\u-29372?\u28304?\u31649?\u29702?(IRM)\u24037?\u20316?\u23618?\u19978?\u30340?\u26368?\u-28211?\u-30335?\u30340?\u-30254?\u-32142?\u26159?______\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u20225?\u19994?\u-26490?\u23548? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u25968?\u25454?\u31649?\u29702?\u21592? \u160?C\u-242?\u25968?\u25454?\u22788?\u29702?\u20154?\u21592? \u160?D\u-242?\u-26503?\u30446?\u-26490?\u23548?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 66\u12289?______\u19981?\u23646?\u20110?\u30005?\u23376?\u-28498?\u20214?\u30456?\u20851?\u21327?\u-29778?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?POP3 \u160? \u160?B\u-242?SMTP \u160? \u160?C\u-242?MIME \u160? \u160?D\u-242?MPLS\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 67\u12289?\u22312?Windows\u25805?\u20316?\u31995?\u32479?\u19979?\u-244?FTP\u23458?\u25143?\u31471?\u21487?\u20197?\u20351?\u29992?______\u21629?\u20196?\u26174?\u31034?\u23458?\u25143?\u31471?\u24403?\u21069?\u30446?\u24405?\u20013?\u30340?\u25991?\u20214?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?!dir \u160? \u160?B\u-242?dir \u160? \u160?C\u-242?get \u160? \u160?D\u-242?put\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 68\u12289?\u20197?\u19979?IP\u22320?\u22336?\u20013?\u-244?\u19981?\u-32515?\u20316?\u20026?\u30446?\u26631?\u22320?\u22336?\u30340?\u26159?______\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?0.0.0.0 \u160? \u160?B\u-242?10.0.0.1 \u160? \u160?C\u-242?100.0.0.1 \u160? \u160?D\u-242?100.10.1.0\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 69\u12289?\u22312?OSI\u19971?\u23618?\u32467?\u26500?\u27169?\u22411?\u20013?\u-244?\u22788?\u20110?\u25968?\u25454?\u-27394?\u-29201?\u23618?\u19982?\u20256?\u-28781?\u23618?\u20043?\u-27148?\u30340?\u26159?______\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u29289?\u29702?\u23618? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u32593?\u32476?\u23618? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u-30616?\u31034?\u23618? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u20250?\u-29731?\u23618?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 70\u12289?Internet\u25552?\u20379?\u20102?\u21508?\u31181?\u26381?\u21153?\u-244?\u22914?\u-28646?\u20449?\u12289?\u-28708?\u31243?\u30331?\u24405?\u12289?\u27983?\u-30264?\u21644?\u25991?\u20214?\u20256?\u-28781?\u31561?\u-244?\u19979?\u21015?\u21508?\u-26503?\u20013?\u-244?______\u19981?\u23646?\u20110?Internet\u25552?\u20379?\u30340?\u26381?\u21153?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?WWW \u160? \u160?B\u-242?HTML \u160? \u160?C\u-242?E-mail \u160? \u160?D\u-242?Newsgroup\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 Information is no good to you if you can't \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?71 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  it\u-242?The loction dimension of information means having access to information no matter where you are\u-242?Ideally, in other words\u-244?your location or the information's location should not matter\u-242?You should be able toaccess information in a hotel room\u-244?at home\u-244?in the student center of your campus\u-244?at work\u-244?onthe spur of the moment while walking down the street\u-244?or even while traveling on an airplane\u-242?This location dimension is closely related to \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?72 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  and wireless computing (and also ubiquitous computing)\u-242?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?To keep certain information private and secure while providing remote access for employees\u-244?many businesses are creating intranets\u-242?An intranet is an \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?73 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  organizational internet that is guarded against outside access by a special \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?74 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  feature called a firewall (which can be software\u-244?hardware\u-244?or a combination of the two)\u-242?So\u-244?if your organization has an intranet and you want to access information on it while away from the office\u-244?all you need is Web access and the password that will allow you \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?75 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  the firewall\u-242?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 71\u12289?A\u-242?access \u160? \u160?B\u-242?make \u160? \u160?C\u-242?learn D\u-242?bring\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 72\u12289?A\u-242?data \u160? \u160?B\u-242?program \u160? \u160?C\u-242?mobile D\u-242?information\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 73\u12289?A\u-242?inside \u160? \u160?B\u-242?external \u160? \u160?C\u-242?inner D\u-242?internal\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 74\u12289?A\u-242?safe \u160? \u160?B\u-242?safety \u160? \u160?C\u-242?security D\u-242?safely\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 75\u12289?A\u-242?pass \u160? \u160?B\u-242?through \u160? \u160?C\u-242?across D\u-242?cross\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \u31572?\u26696?:\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f1\fs28\b \u21333?\u-26503?\u-28663?\u25321?\u-26472?\b0\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 1\u12289?A\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 [\u-30237?\u26512?] \u27969?\u27700?\u32447?\u25216?\u26415?\u26159?\u25226?\u19968?\u20010?\u-28211?\u22797?\u30340?\u-26502?\u24207?\u22788?\u29702?\u-28729?\u31243?\u20998?\u-30237?\u20026?\u-32027?\u24178?\u23376?\u-28729?\u31243?\u-244?\u27599?\u20010?\u23376?\u-28729?\u31243?\u-32515?\u19982?\u20854?\u20182?\u23376?\u-28729?\u31243?\u24182?